editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/state/movement-009/review-cold.md:34:- **The pleasure is the inversion.** Progression fantasy lives on the number going up; this movement's climax is an instrument writing "no number goes here" and a judge spending ninety minutes making sure the sentence doesn't flatter anyone. The FRAGMENT ACQUIRED notice arriving while the healer holds his fingers, with eight thousand people unable to see it, is the genre's own device turned exactly right.
